# A townsperson, look 3 (a countrywoman in a headscarf), 1919: about 45
# (age 0.65), short and sturdy. A long-sleeved, high-necked blouse of
# faded blue, an ankle-length brown wool skirt (pollera) with a cotton
# apron over it, a dark woollen shawl round the shoulders with its ends
# crossed over the chest, high laced boots, and a dark headscarf (panuelo de
# cabeza) framing the face, knotted under the chin, its point down the
# back of the neck; no hair shows. The game tints the blouse, skirt,
# apron, shawl and headscarf per person.
